{"overview":"پسر بچه ای به نام «کوین» (کالکین)، به دلیل شیطنت هایش، شب پیش از سفر خانواده اش برای تعطیلات کریسمس، تنبیه می شود تا در اتاق زیر شیروانی بخوابد، و او هم پیش از خواب آرزو می کند که تمام اعضای خانواده اش ناپدید شوند. صبح روز بعد، همه «کوین» را فراموش می کنند و به سفر می روند و وقتی متوجه نبود او می شوند که دیگر دیر شده است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Eight-year-old Kevin McCallister makes the most of the situation after his family unwittingly leaves him behind when they go on Christmas vacation. When thieves try to break into his home, he puts up a fight like no other.","tagline_en":"A family comedy without the family.","runtime":103,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["کریس کلمبوس"],"crew_en":["Chris Columbus"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"مکالی کالکین","role":"Kevin","photo":"/5We9Y4zUJ5TUnRgfmkzWQx0mLIF.jpg","en":"Macaulay Culkin"},{"name":"جو پشی","role":"Harry","photo":"/pEHQoL8yOndOq59iXlgsOpUTcTk.jpg","en":"Joe Pesci"},{"name":"دنیل استرن","role":"Marv","photo":"/939oerf8bJPrqT2a0N0oGuM1bjn.jpg","en":"Daniel Stern"},{"name":"John Heard","role":"Peter","photo":"/zjhcxrCFK4q0C1gtVmeN8FeqCw0.jpg"},{"name":"Roberts Blossom","role":"Marley","photo":"/CP19Dvjvx2xSrkyJQEdmAC4wug.jpg"},{"name":"کاترین اوهارا","role":"Kate","photo":"/gI2RyymLJ9ZrhEyJSD5EqSvFpCX.jpg","en":"Catherine O'Hara"},{"name":"Angela Goethals","role":"Linnie","photo":"/uX0ZLfklHtIk4IHZqduEvlOiNBL.jpg"},{"name":"Devin Ratray","role":"Buzz","photo":"/uQAINK3xU0SdJXupMtdxzwGc4CS.jpg"},{"name":"Gerry Bamman","role":"Uncle Frank","photo":"/hiMgT6OYvmdgz758vbw4y9iEAns.jpg"},{"name":"Hillary Wolf","role":"Megan","photo":"/80kzfDHcFnolZaX08MTkdxVGrm9.jpg"},{"name":"جون کندی","role":"Gus Polinski","photo":"/uvLWbMDE6UfWNF5tfrsrC9NqeEA.jpg","en":"John Candy"},{"name":"لری هانکین","role":"Officer Balzak","photo":"/2uR8SZ9geiSQOpBhKrerh9qY7CX.jpg","en":"Larry Hankin"}],"trailer":"sptc2IcHnc4","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/771-home-alone/watc